        "answer": {
          "short": "Cumulative frequencies: $15,25,32,43,64$; total frequency $64$. Median $\\approx17.5$.",
          "worked": "The completed cumulative frequencies are $15$, $15+10=25$, $25+7=32$, $32+11=43$ and $43+21=64$.\nTotal frequency is $64$.\n$$\\text{Median position}=\\frac{64}{2}=32.$$\nThe class boundaries are $2.5,7.5,12.5,17.5,22.5,27.5$. Plot the cumulative histogram and join the upper-right corners, starting at $(2.5,0)$.\nRead across from cumulative frequency $32$ to the ogive, then down to the score axis.\nMedian $\\approx17.5$.",
